  "body": "## Description\r\nCloses #98. Implements an isolated offline verification test suite exercising example workflow execution without requiring live network access or external LLM API dependencies.\r\n\r\n## Key Changes\r\n- **`tests/test_verify_example.py`**:\r\n  - Implemented 15 unit and integration tests covering verification workflows, mock transitions, and validation hooks.\r\n  - Added robust cross-platform path normalization compatible with both Windows and Unix (`.resolve()`).\r\n  - Covered edge cases for negative validation branches and rejection flows.\r\n\r\n## Verification\r\n- `pytest -q tests/test_verify_example.py`: **15 passed in 13.18s**.\r\n- `ruff check tests/test_verify_example.py`: **0 lint errors**.\r\n- *Note:* Pre-existing collection errors exist across untargeted baseline test files on clean `HEAD` due to missing package initialization paths.",
